'''Crazed Axe Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by clearing the event stage [[Berserk (Insane)|The Crazed Axe]]. The stage is only available on the '''9th''' and '''28th''' of every month. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] increases health and attack power. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], it is obtainable via [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsules]] after clearing Cosmic Club in the Interstellar Invasion chapter. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], its event and awakening stages are available on '''Tuesdays'''.

{{Cat Info
