}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Crazed Brave Cat''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Manic Dark Cat''' when obtained from [[Unjust War (Deadly)|Axe Maniac]] and is level 20 or above.

==Strategy/Usage==
An underwhelming unit from an overwhelming stage, Crazed Axe Cat has a rather inconvenient combination of stats. Admittedly superior to his normal equivalent, Crazed Axe still retains poor range and stats for his cost, as he absolutely cannot tank the nasty Red pushers to deal any damage, and has even fewer combos. There are rare instances where he can be of help, such as in [[Unkept Promises]] where his insane cost-to-dps ratio shines, but that stage isn't difficult anyway. Crazed Axe Cat therefore should be unlocked after all other Crazed Cats.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

